{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测Windows经PowerShell可疑.NET反射。对应需求：防御规避。官方：Suspicious .NET Reflection via PowerShell。","from":"now-9m","index":["winlogbeat-*","logs-windows.powershell*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】Windows经PowerShell可疑.NET反射","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nWindows经PowerShell可疑.NET反射\n\n### 为何重要\n绕过防护、伪装或擦痕\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对进程名、命令行、父进程、用户与事件ID。\n2. 核对路径、注册表、外连地址与是否符合变更窗口。\n3. 关联同主机前后同类告警、落地文件与凭据操作。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离主机、终止可疑进程并排查落地文件与账号。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警与外连。\n","references":["https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.reflection.assembly.load"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"e26f042e-c590-4e82-8e05-41e81bd822ad","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 Windows 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**（按规则需要进程/网络/文件/注册表或安全日志）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 防御规避","来源: 默认","对应需求: 防御规避"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"event.category:process and host.os.type:windows and\n(\n  powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n    \"[System.Reflection.Assembly]::Load\" or\n    \"[Reflection.Assembly]::Load\" or\n    \"Assembly.Load(\"\n  ) and\n  powershell.file.script_block_text : (\n      \"FromBase64String\" or \"GzipStream\" or \"DeflateStream\" or \"IO.Compression\" or\n      \"MemoryStream\" or \"DownloadData\" or \"WebClient\" or \"ReadAllBytes\"\n  )\n)\n","filters":[{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Monitoring Agent\\Agent\\Health Service State\\Monitoring Host Temporary Files*\\AvailabilityGroupMonitoring.ps1"}}}},{"meta":{"negate":true},"query":{"wildcard":{"file.path":{"case_insensitive":true,"value":"?:\\\\ProgramData\\\\Microsoft\\\\Windows Defender Advanced Threat Protection\\\\DataCollection\\\\*"}}}}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","user.id","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","process.parent.executable","event.action","event.code","file.path","registry.path","source.ip","destination.ip","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","message"]},"threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1055","name":"Process Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1055.001","name":"Dynamic-link Library Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/001/"},{"id":"T1055.002","name":"Portable Executable Injection","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1055/002/"}]},{"id":"T1140","name":"Deobfuscate/Decode Files or Information","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1140/"},{"id":"T1620","name":"Reflective Code Loading","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1620/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0005","name":"Defense Evasion","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0005/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1059","name":"Command and Scripting Interpreter","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1059.001","name":"PowerShell","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0002","name":"Execution","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0002/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、软件分发或安全工具"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"windows","version":"*"}],"version":323,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
